{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bfd8df578801a4e1","name":"Stock Starships","source":{"id":"source:reference-bfd8df578801a4e1","title":"Stock Starships","revision":18815,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:46:57Z","sha256":"85d8ff8cd954081f3c80712e401e2dcadbd189e976b01ec29cc720cb43c6fa4c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18815","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Stock%20Starships&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bfd8df578801a4e1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you need to design a ship from scratch, rather than modify an existing ship, simply start with one of the following Stock Ships. Each Stock Starship has a cost and basic description for a generic, no-frills version of a Starship of that size. To improve the design, use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Modification"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Modification"}," rules to add and improve the systems and abilities you need. A lone character can't design a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," from scratch without the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Designer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Designer","referenceId":"reference:abf9ac6628414f65"}," feat, and even then normally needs the aid of a shipyard to build one.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once you have determined all the systems you want to add to your Stock Starship, you can determine its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"},", attacks, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"}," using the standard rules for these values (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Combat"},"). Remember to select a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crew Quality"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crew_Quality","referenceId":"reference:c79e9b6530a86284"}," when determining these values.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["There is no hard and fast rule to determine the Challenge Level of a new Stock Ship. The easiest way to do so is to compare the new Stock Ship to comparable ships and use that as the basis of a CL, adjusting as necessary for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crew Quality"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crew_Quality","referenceId":"reference:c79e9b6530a86284"}," of the ship.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Stock Ship Types\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["STOCK SHIP\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["STRENGTH\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DEXTERITY\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["INTELLIGENCE\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SPEED\n"],"colspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["HIT POINTS\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DR\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ARMOR\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"],"rowspan":2}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHARACTER SCALE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children