haracter_Scale"}," and then ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},". If the Character Scale value is given as \"-,\"the ship does not function at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Character Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Character_Scale"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Armor:"]}," The Starship's Armor bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," The cost for the Stock Ship's basic frame. This does not include the cost of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrives"},", cargo space, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Shields","referenceId":"reference:70740894b304e903"},". It does include the basic systems required for a ship to function, including ion drives, life support, and basic facilities. The given cost assumes a typical new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," from a typical production facility. Do not multiply the costs for Stock Ships by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"}," for ships of that size. All multipliers for the basic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," frame have already been included in these costs.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Base Values\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["STOCK SHIP\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CREW\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["PASSENGERS\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CARGO CAPACITY\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CONSUMABLES\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["EMPLACEMENT POINTS"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/EMPLACEMENT_POINTS"},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Battlecruiser\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20,000 Tons\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["200\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Cruiser\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10,000 Tons\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["100\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Frigate\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["200\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000 Tons\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1 Year\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["50\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Corvette\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["50\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["200\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2,000 Tons\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1 Year\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Heavy Freighter\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["100,000 Tons\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["6 Months\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gunship\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5 Tons\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1 Month\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Shuttle\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["8\n"]},"\n",{"