or twice that many if you worsen it by 50%). For the purpose of the crew required to operate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},", worsening means increasing the crew required (by 25% or 50%). Any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"}," gained in this way may be kept as spares or used to purchase additional cargo capacity, adding tons of cargo capacity equal to the Stock Ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"}," for each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Point"}," spent.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
